{
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FBFBFE\\,#F5F5FC)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#181A1F\\,#1D1F28)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#5B5BD6|#A5A3FF",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "_note": "源色点(card-design-system §2):5pt 圆点 / 卡名左侧 / 间距 9pt / 每张卡恰好一次。本包的源色 = 进度格用的那支靛 —— 它已经是这个包在盘上的样子,不另起一个。"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "21.0pt",
        "y": "11pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-75pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ttl},__n__),__n__),if::(eq::(${isDef},1),${@i18n.nyd},${@i18n.cdT}),${ttl})]",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "_note": "卡上的名字取 flow 透出的 `ttl`。⚠️ 曾经取的是 `${title}`(shell param),注释还写着「widget params 天然在 RCN 作用域里、不必绕一趟 flow」—— **2026-08-26 iOS 真机实测不成立**:加卡面板的预览里 名字渲成 `--`,而同一张卡的日期是好的(date 走了 depends.params)。于是「这张卡只是没写名字」看着像设计,其实是取值取空。改法与本仓一贯的 §D 纯显式同向:**要什么就显式传什么、显式透什么**。",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "14pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${today},--)]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "_note": "时效锚(§3):右上角 / 9pt / 次级 / 右对齐 / MM-DD。倒数天数每天变一次,而桌面小组件的封面缓存 key 不含时间维度 —— 不写日期就分不出这张卡是今天渲的。"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${abs},--),--),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "num",
            "type": "richText",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "30pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "spans": [
              {
                "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${abs},--)]",
                "fontSize": "42pt",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
              },
              {
                "text": "$[if::(eq::(${abs},1),${@i18n.day1},${@i18n.day})]",
                "fontSize": "13pt",
                "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${abs},--),--),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "numE",
            "type": "richText",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "42.5pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "spans": [
              {
                "text": "--",
                "fontSize": "42pt",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
              },
              {
                "text": "$[if::(eq::(${abs},1),${@i18n.day1},${@i18n.day})]",
                "fontSize": "13pt",
                "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "sub",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "76pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(${past},1),${@i18n.pastDot},)]$[findNotEmpty::(${dateW},--)]",
        "fontSize": "10pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
      },
      {
        "id": "yrn",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "90pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
